{"3471760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aleprok", "steam_appid": 3471760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FREE ACTION–STRATEGY ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok is a free action strategy game made by a solo developer. Explore hostile lands, gather resources, build your clan town, and prepare to defend it against relentless enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No ads. No microtransactions. Just jump in and play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND PREPARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through multiple environments, forests, snowy regions, and dead lands, clearing enemy areas, completing tasks, and unlocking new weapons, buildings, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition strengthens your clan and prepares you for what’s coming next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND YOUR CLAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After exploration comes defense. Enemies will attack your town in waves, targeting your buildings and defenses. Use strategy, positioning, magic, and upgrades to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your preparation directly affects how long you can hold out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSION AND CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons, buildings, shields, and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock active and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and evolve a companion with unique forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use specialized magic to change the flow of battle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together with friends in co-op mode. Build your town, share resources, and defend your clan as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPORTANT NOTE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok uses a simple in-game account (username + password only) to save progress and enable multiplayer features. No email required. No personal data collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok is a passion project and a learning experience. Feedback is welcome and appreciated.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FREE ACTION–STRATEGY ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok is a free action strategy game made by a solo developer. Explore hostile lands, gather resources, build your clan town, and prepare to defend it against relentless enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No ads. No microtransactions. Just jump in and play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND PREPARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through multiple environments, forests, snowy regions, and dead lands, clearing enemy areas, completing tasks, and unlocking new weapons, buildings, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition strengthens your clan and prepares you for what’s coming next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND YOUR CLAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After exploration comes defense. Enemies will attack your town in waves, targeting your buildings and defenses. Use strategy, positioning, magic, and upgrades to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your preparation directly affects how long you can hold out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROGRESSION AND CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons, buildings, shields, and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock active and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and evolve a companion with unique forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use specialized magic to change the flow of battle</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together with friends in co-op mode. Build your town, share resources, and defend your clan as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPORTANT NOTE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok uses a simple in-game account (username + password only) to save progress and enable multiplayer features. No email required. No personal data collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleprok is a passion project and a learning experience. Feedback is welcome and appreciated.</p>", "short_description": "A cooperative survival and strategy game where you explore diverse environments, build and defend your clan town, upgrade weapons and skills, and master magic to survive relentless enemy attacks.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Korean, Polish, Slovak", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471760/header.jpg?t=1768572178", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471760/c49f14fa65ebbcfb0a8db69eb8a11ea9a44e9f4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768572178", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471760/c49f14fa65ebbcfb0a8db69eb8a11ea9a44e9f4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768572178", "website": "https://aleprok.azurewebsites.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8.1/10/11 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB memory (dedicated VRAM or shared RAM), Shader Model 2.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB m